<h1>Subscription Canceled</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.email %>,</p>

<p>
  Your subscription has been canceled. Your account has been switched to the
  Free plan, which includes 50 links and 50 QR codes.
</p>

<p>
  All your existing links and QR codes will continue to work. If you'd like
  to upgrade again in the future, you can do so at any time.
</p>

<hr class="divider">

<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px;">
  <a href="<%= ENV['DEV_HOST'] || 'https://thin.ly' %>/plans" class="button">View Plans</a>
</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">
  <a href="<%= ENV['DEV_HOST'] || 'https://thin.ly' %>/" class="button button--secondary">Go to Dashboard</a>
</p>

<hr class="divider">

<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #a8aaaf;">
  We'd love to hear your feedback. Reply to this email or contact
  <a href="mailto:support@thin.ly" style="color: #a8aaaf;">support@thin.ly</a>.
</p>